WEBVTT

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:09.410
Hikari-chan...

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:14.410
Hikari Kagura-san.

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:20.580
You are the successful candidate of this audition.

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:27.200
As such, the "shine" of the Stage Girls has become yours.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:33.200
Having been given fuel, you have set the furnace alight.

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:37.200
Now then, what fateful stage do you desire?

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.370
I don't need it.

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:43.370
Pardon?

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:47.250
I don't need any "fuel."

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:54.620
The stage requires considerable fuel to burn
in one's chest and set the heart ablaze...

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:57.410
And yet... you shall do it alone?

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.700
That's what you want to see, isn't it?
A stage that you can't predict.

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:07.410
This is my "Starlight."

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:10.500
I understand.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:16.830
The auditions have now concluded...

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:21.040
Let the curtain rise on this Stage of Fate!

00:01:44.550 --> 00:01:49.370
Revue Starlight

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:58.200
Ano hoshi o tsukamu no wa daare?
Who, oh who, will be the one to grab hold of the star?

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:05.160
Tou no choujou de
At the very top of that tower

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:19.540
Shizuka ni tomotta honou ga atsuku mune o kogashite iku
These flames lit in silence fill my chest with a white-hot passion

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:21.790
Unmei no wa
That's just the Wheel of Fortune

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:29.500
Butai no ue de odorasareteiru wake ja nai
It's not like I'm being forced to dance on this stage

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.700
Tobitate
Spring forth

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:35.580
Tashika ni ano hi mitanda
I'm sure I saw it that day

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:39.200
Hajiketa hoshi no kirameki
The brilliance of a star that has burst open

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:45.660
Iroaseta yakusoku ni yubi ga fureru made
Until my fingers reach out to touch that faded promise

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:49.750
Makuake mae ni hajimaru
It will start before the curtain rises

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:53.290
Me no mae de tsuzurareteku
And be spelled out before our eyes

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:56.870
Umarekawatta watashi wa
Having been reborn

00:02:56.870 --> 00:03:00.700
Koko de kimi ni aeta
I was able to meet you here

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:04.330
Mou ichido
Once again

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:10.250
Auditions | Concluded

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.000
Notice of Withdrawal

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:24.160
She withdrew?!

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:28.510
Notice of Withdrawal

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:28.510
99th Class     Group 2-A

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:28.250
Sh-she dropped out?!

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:31.620
Hikari-chan's gone?! Ma'am, what...?

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:32.410
Yeah.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:35.500
Wait, hold on! I don't get it!

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:37.080
Karen-chan...

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:40.580
She's submitted all the necessary paperwork.

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:43.140
Seisho
Music Academy
Hikari
Kagura

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:43.160
No way... It can't be!

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:46.290
Hikari-chan wouldn't just go off on her own!

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.200
She'd never...

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.080
Aijo.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:54.290
Ma'am, what did Hikari-chan say?

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:55.450
Nothing.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.450
If she quit school, where is she going?!

00:03:58.160 --> 00:03:59.120
Beats me.

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:03.700
But, why? Why'd she go off on her own?!

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:05.670
HIKARI

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:08.830
It can't be true. There's no way!

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:10.700
Karen-chan...

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:16.410
The number you are trying to call is not reachable.

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:17.750
This is crazy!

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:22.250
The number you are trying to call is-

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.660
This is just... It can't be!

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:31.330
The number you are trying to call is not reachable.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:32.440
This can't be happening!

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:34.950
Auditions | Concluded

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:50.710
Auditions | Concluded

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:53.040
Ah! Um...

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:57.700
"I am Karen Aijo! From Japan!"

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:56.220
The Royal Academy of Theatrical Actors

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:05.040
Uh, "Also, I sometimes want to ask..."

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:08.870
"Yes! Hikari Kagura!"

00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:11.730
Auditions | Concluded

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:15.120
Hikari Kagura-san, 16 years old...

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:18.910
And you say your calls and messages
aren't reaching her?

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:20.290
Yes.

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:23.790
But she DID submit a notice of withdrawal, yes?

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:26.200
But there's no way that could be right!

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:36.120
I see. Well, is it all right if
we ask a few more questions?

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:37.790
Okay...

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:41.040
Where did you last see her?

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:45.660
Well, about that...

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:48.080
That's sort of...

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:51.150
Auditions | Concluded

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:58.200
Hikari-chan, where are you?

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:00.160
Please write back.

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:00.160
Hey, say something.

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:00.160
I'm worried. For real.

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:00.160
I'm gonna go look for you.

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:00.160
Hikari-chan, where are you?

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:08.160
Auditions | Concluded

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:10.160
Wow!

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:12.670
"Starlight"
Notice of Main Cast Picks

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.160
Claire
Maya Tendo
Flora
Claudine Saijo

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:17.040
Nana Daiba

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:17.580
Junna Hoshimi

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:18.120
Mahiru Tsuyuzaki

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:18.790
Futaba Isurugi

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:19.830
Kaoruko Hanayagi

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:20.660
Karen Aijo

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:23.180
Auditions | Concluded

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:39.450
Auditions | Concluded

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:52.120
The number you are trying to call is not reachable.
The number you are trying to-

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:57.000
Good morning.

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:58.460
I'm lonely.

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:58.460
Without you, I’m just...

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:58.460
I'm waiting to hear from you.

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:58.460
Good Morning

00:06:58.460 --> 00:06:59.720
Without you, I’m just...

00:06:58.460 --> 00:06:59.720
I'm waiting to hear from you.

00:06:58.460 --> 00:06:59.720
Good Morning

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:12.620
Let's go, Mahiru-chan.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:17.750
This cold could even freeze a banana!

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.000
It's the coldest day of the year.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:23.120
You've never felt cold like this, have you?

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:26.950
This is a first for me.

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:36.040
Aren't you cold, Karen-chan?

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:37.950
Hot Banana.

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:44.830
Dear Miss Hikari Kagura...

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:48.700
How are you doing in this cold weather?

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:55.000
The 100th Seisho Festival is coming up soon.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:08:00.540
We're prepping for it by practicing every day.

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:06.120
Everyone in Group B stays late to get
our stage production ready.

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:10.040
Starlight

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:12.830
This will be a more evolved "Starlight,"
even better than last year's.

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:21.200
It was the first stage that I thought
I would be sharing with you.

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:26.080
Say, Hikari-chan...

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:31.330
Do you remember our promise?

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:34.250
Everyone who'll stay behind, raise your hands.

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:35.500
Me!

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:39.080
Group B, six people in the scenery group...

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:41.830
Okay, I'll submit an application for you all.

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:44.500
All right. Sorry for the wait!

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:47.370
It's a Banana specialty: the Banancier!

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:49.620
Oh! I've been looking forward to this!

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:51.950
This will get us through another long day!

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:55.040
Stop, stop!

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:03.870
Aijo-san!

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:06.120
Are you in pain?

00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:08.120
No...

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:11.620
Then why are you only performing to that level?

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:15.500
Is this about Kagura-san?

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:21.250
It's been at least half a year since she withdrew, hasn't it?

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:23.370
How long will you keep clinging to-?

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:24.540
Amemiya-san!

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.040
I'm sorry.

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:31.660
I'm sure it's rough, but you have to snap out of it.

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:34.950
The Seisho Festival is right around the corner.

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.540
Yeah... I'm sorry.

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:43.540
If it's too much for you, we'll find a replacement. Okay?

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:46.620
Karen-chan...

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:48.790
I'm sorry.

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:51.330
But, I'll be fine.

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:52.410
Indeed.

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:55.660
This is no time for you to lose your resolve.

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:57.540
Get it out of your head already!

00:09:58.790 --> 00:09:59.660
Okay!

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:05.000
Below a shooting star that falls once a year...

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:07.500
Flora and I...

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.410
Claire and I...

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:12.080
had our fateful encounter.

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:16.700
It's as if we've been together forever!

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:19.790
Let's meet here again next year...

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:22.950
On the night of this Star Festival!

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:28.040
I wonder what's happened to me...

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:32.410
I don't feel a thing.

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:39.540
The nervousness of being on stage,
the thrill of singing up there...

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:45.080
All the "shine" I feel when I'm on stage is...

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:52.080
Karen-chan?

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:55.580
I don't get it anymore.

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:59.870
Why should I be on stage?

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:03.910
If Hikari-chan isn't here anymore, then...

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:08.120
why am I even on stage?

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.410
I can't do it.

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:12.250
Huh?

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:20.330
I love the stage, but now I... I don't know why I'm here!

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:24.870
In that audition, if you can't pass then it's all over.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:31.040
Should you fail, you'll lose what's
most important to you as a Stage Girl.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:34.660
I get it now.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:39.450
I don't understand, but I get it.

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:43.540
I made Hikari-chan...
what's most important to me... go away!

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:45.290
The most important thing...

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:47.790
Karen-chan?

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:53.120
Hikari-chan!

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.700
An audition where we fight one another for the "shine"...

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:06.290
That's the fuel for the Stage of Fate, huh?

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:11.580
The joy, the pleasure, the thrill of standing on stage...

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:19.410
The happiness of dancing up there,
the love of song, the glare of the stage lights...

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:29.000
Being robbed of that was a death sentence
for Kagura-san as a Stage Girl.

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:34.080
And yet... we have lost nothing.

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:39.500
None of the pleasure or joy or
exhilaration of being on stage...

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:42.790
Is it because Kagura didn't take it from us?

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:45.080
But... how come?

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:48.790
She became the Top Star, so why didn't she...?

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:54.660
Maybe because she couldn't. She didn't want...

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:58.000
She didn't want to take Karen-chan's shine.

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:01.000
And that ended up working in our favor too.

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:03.500
Still, no one asked her to do that.

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:13.290
In any case, where do you think Hikari-chan
went now that she's thrown it all away?

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:19.830
This is my "Starlight."

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:27.500
Maybe it's like Banana said...

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:33.700
"Starlight" is... a story about separation, and it's sad.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:41.540
I can't read this on my own, Hikari-chan.

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:51.910
"This is a story... of a... 'nearbu'? And distant planet."

00:13:58.290 --> 00:14:00.160
Karen-chan, I'm back!

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:03.200
Banana-chan made dinner for...

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:11.120
That's "Starlight"? Are you translating it?

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:12.540
Yeah.

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:30.160
"If you catch a small star, you've obtained
a small bit of happiness."

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:39.200
"If you catch a large star,
you've obtained a large fortune."

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:39.930
ENGLISH

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:46.120
"If you catch both of them,
you've caught an eternal wish."

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:53.410
"Grasping the Star means forgiveness for your sins."

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:58.290
"Grasping the Star is a miracle of the Night!"

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:07.750
"Flora, whose eyes had been scorched by
the Star's shine, fell from the Tower..."

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:13.790
"Left alone, Claire was imprisoned
in the Tower of Starlight Gathering."

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:24.370
"She became the new prisoner to atone for their sin."

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:28.950
"Imprisoned"?

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:33.330
In the "Starlight" we've seen up 'til now...

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:40.870
Flora fell from the Tower and
was separated from Claire for eternity.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:42.910
That was how it's ended.

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:50.290
The direction and the script have
been a little different, but...

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:56.540
Claire has always been confined to the Tower...

00:15:57.580 --> 00:15:59.370
To the Tower?

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:03.290
So then...!

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:11.290
Hikari-chan...

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:14.700
Hikari-chan!

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:18.120
Hikari-chan!

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:27.160
To atone for the sin of trying
to claim the Star, on that stage, she...

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:34.830
But, that... that's not OUR stage.

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:41.540
We haven't stood on that stage yet!

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:46.160
Our performance still hasn't started!

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:51.950
Answer me, Hikari-chan!

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:56.200
We still haven't...

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:00.870
...done "Starlight"!

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:36.580
Hikari-chan!

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:54.950
The Knowledge of
a Stage Girl

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:09.250
The crime of attempting to grasp the Star, huh?

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:17.660
So then, we Stage Girls who aimed to become
the Top Star are steeped in sin, aren't we?

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:21.580
But... so what?

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:23.770
Grab hold of
your own star!!

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:27.830
No matter what anyone says...

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:31.540
I will grasp that star! A star all my own!

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:35.080
So, tell Kagura-san...

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:38.080
We'll be waiting for her on stage.

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:54.620
We all had different beginnings
and different stories, but we met...

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:58.250
and all stood on the same stage, right?

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:09.080
We disagreed and butted heads, but together,
we were able to find our "shine"!

00:19:09.950 --> 00:19:12.950
We met for a reason, I'm sure of it.

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:18.330
That's why... we're waiting for you on stage.

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:25.040
The inseparable bond of the stage, eh?

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:30.910
It's thanks to the stage that we're all here now.

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:35.160
We've shared the same stage, eaten the same food...

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:38.160
We Stage Girls are all connected!

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:41.160
We'll be waiting for you on stage.

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:43.120
We're all waiting!

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:46.500
A light that is never extinguished...

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:51.500
A never-ending passion and excitement...

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:54.870
99th
STARLI

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:56.620
The moment that will last forever, burned into memory...

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:03.870
It's precisely because this will someday end
that we burn with such intensity in the present.

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:08.160
For that moment, to be together with you...

00:20:09.620 --> 00:20:11.700
we'll be waiting on stage.

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:21.750
The stage is our heart...

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:25.870
Song is our pulse, and passion is our blood.

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:29.910
It is the stage that gives us life.

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:34.750
Even injured or defeated,

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:38.120
it is the stage that revives us.

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:44.000
A Stage Girl can be reborn, time and time again.

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:46.330
That's why...

00:20:47.960 --> 00:20:50.170
We're waiting
for you on stage!

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:56.700
We'll be waiting on the stage.

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:11.750
Wait for me... on stage.

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:38.790
That's...!

00:21:39.340 --> 00:21:43.350
KAREN

00:21:39.340 --> 00:21:41.350
99 Unread Messages

00:21:41.350 --> 00:21:43.350
Latest Message

00:21:41.350 --> 00:21:43.350
Do you remember?
We made a promise.

00:21:49.860 --> 00:21:53.870
Ticket
The Stage of Fate
Do You Remember? We made a Promise
CAST
Hikari Kagura

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:52.540
A ticket?

00:21:59.370 --> 00:22:01.450
Hikari-chan...

00:22:04.290 --> 00:22:08.790
Student number one from the 99th class
of Seisho Music Academy!

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:10.410
Karen Aijo...

00:22:11.620 --> 00:22:12.660
ready to begin!

00:22:23.830 --> 00:22:31.830
I've watched you for so long

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:39.450
It seems you've set your loneliness aside

00:22:39.450 --> 00:22:43.540
On this night, even the moon

00:22:43.540 --> 00:22:47.080
Grins

00:22:47.080 --> 00:22:50.040
Look this way

